=== Collaboration Trace: Agent A (Researcher) → Agent B (Writer) ===
Example: "Research the state of multimodal LLMs in 2026 (Agent A), then write a professional blog post (Agent B)."

--- Agent A (Researcher) - Internal Dialogue ---
[NODE: researcher]
Input: topic="The state of multimodal LLMs in 2026"
Action: Calling tavily_search_tool(query="multimodal LLMs 2026", max_results=5)
Observation: Retrieved 5 search results with URLs and snippets.
Action: Calling retrieve_from_knowledge_base_tool(query="blog writing guidelines structure", k=4)
Observation: Retrieved domain guidelines (headers, citations, code snippets).
Action: Stopping - sufficient evidence gathered.
Output: evidence=[{title, url, snippet}, ...], passed to next node.

--- Handover: Researcher → RAG Retrieve → Orchestrator ---
State transfer: evidence + rag_chunks flow to Writer persona.

--- Agent B (Writer) - Internal Dialogue ---
[NODE: orchestrator]
Input: evidence from Agent A, rag_chunks (guidelines)
Action: Creating Plan (blog_title, tasks with goals, bullets, target_words).
Output: plan with 4-6 section tasks.

[NODE: worker] (parallel workers for each section)
Input: task, plan, evidence, rag_chunks from state
Action: LLM generates one markdown section. No tool calls.
Output: (task_id, markdown_section)

[NODE: merge_content]
Input: All worker outputs
Action: Merge sections in order.
Output: merged_md (full blog post)

--- Final ---
Writer (Agent B) has produced the complete blog from Researcher's (Agent A) evidence.
